versity student, has just broken up with his girlfriend after he fled alone when the two encountered a kappa. Seeing this as her chance to become closer with him, Kotoko immediately makes her move, hoping to get married to Kurou one day. However, she quickly realizes there is something more to Kurou. With this knowledge, she asks for his help in solving the various issues presented by the supernatural, all the while wishing her newfound partner will eventually reciprocate her feelings."],"ja":["虚構推理",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-64773":"2025-02-23T21:05:45Z","serial-50502":"2023-04-18T17:51:13Z","serial-22668":"2024-06-10T16:08:47Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-64773","serial-50502","serial-22668"],"relatedMalIds":[44204],"rating":6.92,"relations":[{"id":44204,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}